{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","那非"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名受到狩猎之神眷顾的射手，擅长投掷长矛对敌人进行狩猎。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","看到猎物了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","The hunter waits."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","好的猎手，应当不断精进。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","A good hunter always improves."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","瞄准，追踪——！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","You're within my sight!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","鲜血……染红了丛林……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Blood... Blood...Everywhere..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","不出所料。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","The hunt always ends my way."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","我追踪到了你的气息"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","I've tracked you down."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","……嗯？嗬！看什么？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Hmm... Oh. What are you looking at."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哼 啧，都是血……"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","No issues. Body's loose. All good."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","没有异常，很好。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","*Hmhp* It's just blood."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","谢了，它应该对我有用。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","送我？没这个必要。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我不吃肉"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","不错的休憩处"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这里应该没有危险"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","有不少人害怕与那非对视，只因他的瞳孔是方型的。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","那非是个非常识时务的人，懂得何时应该低头——尽管他的脖颈和膝盖从不弯曲。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","在雅库伯尔的预言中，双尾之人有两个灵魂，有双倍的力量和勇气，将得到狩猎神的眷顾。那非本人对此却讳莫如深，不置可否。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","即使面对近乎垂直的崖壁，那非也可以仅依靠双腿，轻松攀跃而上。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","那非的视野极为宽阔，甚至有人传言他清晰地看到身后的一切，从未有人能成功从背后向他发动袭击。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","和冷硬的外表不同，那非的歌声非常温柔多情，总是带有一丝淡淡的忧愁。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","赢得猎血节的胜利后，那非的沉默更胜从前。所有人都说这是因为他的心性被锤炼得更加强大，只有他自己知道真正的原因。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","很少有人会用“傲慢”这个词来评价那非。在崇尚武力的雅库伯尔人眼里，强大如他，即便蔑视首领，又有何不可？"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","尽管那非狩猎技巧超群，但他很少享用肉类，甚至算得上是一个彻头彻尾的素食主义者。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","那非很少和其他人闲聊，并非他不善言辞，而是因为他的气势过于强大，仅仅是站在那里，冷淡地扫上一眼，就足以吓跑绝大多数试图和他搭话的战士。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","不得不说，你的狩猎神伪装很拙劣。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411140.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","那非 & 摩根"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","兽主丛林"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","那非，你在研究什么？"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411210.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","加拉 & 那非"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","深壑山原"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","……不要一直盯着我的尾巴。"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411230.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","那非 & 加拉"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","深壑山原"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","你很珍视你的矛。"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411240.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","加拉 & 那非"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","深壑山原"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","逐影营地的长老，都罗，他多大了？"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411250.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","加拉 & 那非"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","深壑山原"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","你就是他们说的战神，布鲁特斯？"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415705.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","那非 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","我不吃肉"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415715.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","那非"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","不错的休憩处"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415716.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","那非"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","没想到还能再见到你。"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415759.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","戈丹 & 那非"]]}